  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Belice - Iniciativa Regional para la Eliminacin de la Malaria (RMEI) en Mesoamrica y Repblica Dominicana</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Belize - Regional Malaria Elimination Intitative (RMEI) in Mesoamerica and Dominican Republic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyar tcnica y financieramente a Belice para co-financiar la inversin en salud en las reas de mayor incidencia de Malaria para implementar intervenciones costo efectivas que conduzcan a la eliminacin bajo un esquema de financiamiento basado en resultados.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support technically and financially to Belize to co-finance investment in health, in the areas with the highest incidence of Malaria, to implement cost-effective interventions that lead to elimination under a results-based financing scheme.</narrative>
  </description>
